Package: argon-core
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 network-manager,
 apparmor,
 apparmor-profiles,
 apparmor-utils,
 ufw,
 fail2ban,
 python3-systemd,
 unattended-upgrades,
 apt-listchanges,
 needrestart,
 chrony,
 mat2,
 cryptsetup,
 sudo,
 ca-certificates,
 gnupg
Description: Argon OS base system (metapackage)
 Pulls in the hardening and privacy baseline every Argon system ships
 with: AppArmor, UFW, fail2ban, unattended security upgrades,
 NTS-authenticated time sync and metadata cleaning tools.

Package: argon-desktop-xfce
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 argon-core,
 xfce4,
 xfce4-terminal,
 xfce4-whiskermenu-plugin,
 lightdm,
 lightdm-gtk-greeter,
 light-locker,
 thunar-archive-plugin,
 mousepad,
 ristretto,
 firefox-esr,
 network-manager-gnome,
 arc-theme,
 papirus-icon-theme,
 fonts-noto-core,
 pipewire,
 pipewire-pulse,
 wireplumber,
 pavucontrol
Description: Argon OS XFCE desktop (metapackage)
 The default Argon desktop: XFCE with dark Nordic theming, hardened
 Firefox ESR and PipeWire audio.

Package: argon-privacy-tools
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 tor,
 torsocks,
 mat2,
 wireguard-tools,
 openvpn
Recommends: onionshare
Description: Argon OS privacy tooling (metapackage)
 Optional privacy tools: Tor with torsocks, metadata cleaning (mat2)
 and VPN clients (WireGuard, OpenVPN). Tor is installed disabled;
 enable it with `systemctl enable --now tor`.

Package: argon-dev-tools
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 git,
 build-essential,
 python3,
 python3-pip,
 python3-venv
Recommends: golang, rustc, cargo, podman, docker.io
Description: Argon OS development profile (metapackage)
 Optional developer toolchain: git, C/C++, Python, and (as recommends)
 Go, Rust and container runtimes.
